    "media:imagetext": "Seattle\nSafe\nDiego\nCocktails\nUNITED'S VERY DRY BEEFEATER MARTINI\nUNITED'S VERY DRY SMIRNOFF SILVER VODKA MARTINI\nOLD FASHIONED\nMANHATTAN\nSCREWDRIVER\nBLOODY MARY\nWHISKEY SOUR\nSpirits\nOLD GRAND DAD BOURBON\nJ\u0026 B RARE SCOTCH\nDEWAR'S WHITE LABEL SCOTCH\nCANADIAN CLUB\nJACK DANIELS TENNESSEE WHISKEY\nBoston\nBEEFEATER GIN\nSMIRNOFF VODKA\nBACARDI RUM\nCHRISTIAN BROTHERS BRANDY\n1.50\nWines and Beer\nCHAMPAGNE\nDRY SACK SHERRY\nDOMESTIC BEER\n1.00\nBERINGER PINOT NOIR - VINTAGE\nBERINGER CHENIN BLANC\n1.00 with complimentary refills\nLiqueurs\nBENEDICTINE AND BRANDY\nGRASSHOPPER\nCAFE de LOVE\nCREME DE MENTHE\nCOGNAC\nRUSTY NAIL\nA MARETTO di SARONNO\n1.50\n* * *\nCoca•Cola\nSOFT BEVERAGES\nMinors Cannot Be Served Liquor.\nSalad\nTOSSED GREEN SALAD\nA crisp assortment of fresh greens served with\ntomato and a specially prepared dressing.\nYour Choice of\nBROILED FILET MIGNON, BERCY SAUCE\nA choice filet mignon seasoned, broiled and served\nwith an Herb Sauce.\nDUCHESSE POTATOES\nMEDLEY of VEGETABLES\nTHE CHEF'S SPECIALTY\nSEAFOOD NEWBURG\nTender nuggets of Pacific seafood are mixed with a rich Newburg Sauce.\nWe've added rice and peas for a well-rounded meal.\nDenver\nPhiladelphia\nNew\nOrleans\nOUR LIGHTER AIR FARE\nIt is as satisfying, but not quite as filling, as our more elaborate entrees.\nToday we offer:\nDELI SANDWICH\nDINNER ROLL\nBUTTER\nDESSERT\nBeverages\nCOFFEE\nTEA\nMILK\nSanka\nPlease accept our apology if, due to previous passenger\nselections, your choice is not available.\nS. EAST\nI D4-2",
